    "a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c": {
      "type": "feature_columns",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-0": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC05521.jpg",
            "title": "48V LED Headlight",
            "text": "<p>High-end headlights, low power consumption, high brightness, wide range, can see everything ahead when driving at night, and play a role in reminding pedestrians and vehicles.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "title": "Integrated Brake Rear Light",
            "text": "<p>Whether it is day or night, the light reminder function when braking can keep the rear pedestrians and vehicles at a safe distance. At the same time, the tail lights can also keep on to prevent rear-end collisions at night.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "template--17032844771617__a3f88e20-2a8e-40dc-ab10-17993b70201c-1670754134efff77e9-2": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC05530.jpg",
            "title": "The 7-speed Shifter",
            "text": "<p>The high-end version of the seven-speed transmission system can maintain the ideal pedaling pace and torque no matter whether it is climbing, flat road or downhill.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "f2f3354c-bc4e-4d7f-aa3e-1db2687a26b2": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC05605.jpg",
            "title": "Mechanical Hydraulic Brakes",
            "text": "<p>Sensitive front and rear hydraulic brakes cooperate with the suspension system to reduce the impact caused by inertia when braking.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "c45f12b7-ddd3-4814-94a7-71cfe4d9a6f5": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC05581.jpg",
            "title": "Extra Long Double Seat",
            "text": "<p>Different from conventional ebikes, macfox has an extra-long comfortable seat and uses PU memory foam to eliminate the fatigue for the rider during long-distance riding.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "950277aa-027b-4e9c-8494-5e3f28f4d693": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "title": "Ergonomic Half Twist Throttle",
            "text": "<p>When tired of pedaling, take a break and cruise. Gently twist the throttle on your right to accelerate.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "505ead31-83a3-43e8-9f16-ea73626a603a": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "title": "Adjustable Saddle",
            "text": "<p>This bike seat is a durable and comfortable saddle that decreases the impact of road bumps. You may adjust your posture by moving the saddle up and down as well as back and forth.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "26058b19-7c3d-4553-8d4f-6b60586ef119": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC05670.jpg",
            "title": "20\"*4.0\" CST Tires",
            "text": "<p>The fierce thick tire and knobby tread pattern still maintain strong grip and traction in harsh terrains such as dry land, mud, asphalt and sand.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "ae6269df-143d-4f81-87eb-9dc771c3f251": {
          "type": "text_block",
